config OMCI
	tristate "ONU Management and Control Interface agent"
	depends on NET
	help
	  Provides an in-kernel baseline OMCI agent for GPON devices. The
	  subsystem parses OMCI requests, maintains the operational managed-
	  entity database, generates OLT responses, and exposes configuration,
	  MIB objects, events, and statistics through Generic Netlink.

	  Extended OMCI parsing and hardware-specific provisioning remain
	  optional capabilities supplied by the GPON hardware driver.
